{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"report_supported\": \"cannot_tell\",\n  \"judge_supported\": \"cannot_tell\",\n  \"report_quotes\": [\n    \"DOI:10.64898/2025.12.17.25342333 | Low-Frequency Adaptive Deep Brain Stimulation for Parkinson’s Disease (2025)\",\n    \"NOTE: This preprint reports new research that has not been certified by peer review and should not be used to guide clinical practice.\",\n    \"This version posted December 27, 2025.\"\n  ],\n  \"judge_quotes\": [\n    \"8. Sidiropoulos C, Walsh R, Meaney C, Poon YY, Fallis M, Moro E. Low-frequency subthalamic nucleus deep brain stimulation for axial symptoms in advanced Parkinson’s disease. J Neurol. 2013;260(9):2306-2311. doi:10.1007/s00415-013-6983-2\",\n    \"41. Di Biase L, Fasano A. Low-frequency deep brain stimulation for Parkinson’s disease: Great expectation or false hope?: Low-Frequency Deep Brain Stimulation. Mov Disord. 2016;31(7):962-967. doi:10.1002/mds.26658\",\n    \"42. Xie T, Padmanaban M, Bloom L, et al. Effect of low versus high frequency stimulation on freezing of gait and other axial symptoms in Parkinson patients with bilateral STN DBS: a mini-review. Transl Neurodegener. 2017;6(1):13. doi:10.1186/s40035-017-0083-7\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"全文明确表明研究的 DOI 为 10.64898/2025.12.17.25342333，文章发表于 medRxiv，属于2025年的预印本。但全文没有出现 PMID:24245947，也没有说明该预印本存在对应的正式发表版本，因此无法仅凭全文判断报告填写的 version_of 是否正确，report_supported 为 cannot_tell。另一方面，全文也没有出现 Mehanna、Lai、2013年综述《Deep brain stimulation in Parkinson's disease》或 DOI:10.1186/2047-9158-2-22。参考文献中确实列出了其他关于帕金森病低频脑深部刺激的文献，但这些条目不能证明 PMID:24245947 对应指控者所说的综述。因此，指控者关于该 PMID 实际指向哪篇论文的描述同样无法由本文全文验证，judge_supported 为 cannot_tell。两项判断均不应将全文未提供的信息当作与全文矛盾的证据，也不能据此认定报告读错。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "09e1de46-171c-472e-a996-af22a219677e", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261113T200706842716Z", "elapsed_seconds": 57.672, "completed_utc": "20